contact+='''<section id="enquiry"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><aside><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PROJECT STARTS HERE</p><h2>A little context.<br>A clearer next step.</h2><p>Include the work, location, timing and systems involved. Please do not include passwords, payroll records or sensitive customer information.</p><div class="notice"><b>Website enquiries</b><p>This form sends your enquiry to HeyDock through a server-side email service. Confirmation appears only after the provider accepts the message.</p></div>'''+contact_email_block+'''</aside><div><form id="enquiry-form" action="/api/enquiry" method="post"><div class="form-grid"><label>Customer type<select name="audience"><option value="business">Direct business</option><option value="partner">IT company / partner</option></select></label><label>Service<select name="service"><option value="it-support">IT support</option><option value="engineer-dispatch">Engineer dispatch</option><option value="remote-talent">Remote technical talent</option><option value="custom-software">Custom software or website</option><option value="software">Ready-made software</option><option value="ai-automation">AI automation or chatbot</option><option value="coverage">Coverage enquiry</option></select></label><label>Company name<input name="company" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization"></label><label>Your name<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Business email<input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="180" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Country / city<input name="location" required maxlength="150"></label><label>Preferred timing<select name="timing"><option>Exploring options</option><option>Within 2 weeks</option><option>Within 1 month</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>Specific date to discuss</option></select></label><label>Budget indication<select name="budget"><option>To be scoped</option><option>Under £1,000</option><option>£1,000–£5,000</option><option>£5,000–£15,000</option><option>£15,000+</option></select></label><label class="full">What would you like to achieve?<textarea name="scope" required minlength="15" maxlength="5000" rows="6" placeholder="Describe the task, users, sites or workflow. Include any important deadline."></textarea></label><label class="hp full" aria-hidden="true">Company website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" maxlength="200"></label><label class="check full"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1" required> I agree to send this enquiry to HeyDock so they can respond about the services requested. See <a href="/privacy.html">privacy information</a>.</label></div><p id="enquiry-status" class="form-status" hidden role="status"></p><button class="btn" type="submit">Send enquiry <span>↗</span></button><p class="small">Entries are not kept in browser storage. Submitting does not create a booking or contract until separately agreed.</p></form><div id="enquiry-success" hidden tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">ENQUIRY SENT</p><h3>Thanks — your message was accepted.</h3><p role="status">HeyDock has received your enquiry. We will review coverage and scope, then reply using the email you provided.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn ghost" type="button" id="retry-enquiry">Send another enquiry</button>'''+(f'<a class="btn" href="mailto:{E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}">Email {E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}</a>' if CONTACT_EMAIL else '')+'''</div></div></div></div></section>'''
