page('privacy.html','Privacy information','How the HeyDock website handles enquiry and hosting information.',hero('WEBSITE INFORMATION','Privacy.<br><em>Clearly explained.</em>','This notice describes how the public HeyDock website processes information when you browse pages or send an enquiry.')+section('HOW WE HANDLE INFORMATION','What this website does.','', '<div class="prose"><h3>Website operator</h3>'+operator_privacy+'<h3>Enquiry form</h3><p>When you submit the contact form, HeyDock processes the details you provide (customer type, service interest, company, name, email, location, timing, budget indication and description) to respond to your enquiry. The lawful basis is steps toward a contract / legitimate interests in answering business enquiries. Fields are validated on the server. Enquiry text is sent by POST to a Cloudflare Pages Function and then to the configured email provider (Resend) for delivery to the monitored business inbox. Enquiry contents are not placed in page URLs and are not stored in browser storage by this site.</p><h3>Email delivery provider</h3><p>Resend processes enquiry messages for delivery. Configure <code>RESEND_API_KEY</code>, <code>HEYDOCK_FROM_EMAIL</code> and <code>HEYDOCK_TO_EMAIL</code> in the hosting environment only. Retention in the mailbox and provider dashboards follows those systems’ settings; purge or export requests can be made through the privacy contact channel above.</p><h3>Hosting</h3><p>Production hosting is intended for Cloudflare Pages. The platform may process technical request data under its own terms. This site does not add advertising trackers or analytics scripts.</p><h3>Cookies and browser storage</h3><p>The website code does not set tracking cookies or persist form entries. Catalogue filters operate within the current page.</p><h3>Your rights</h3><p>Depending on applicable law you may request access, correction, deletion or objection. Use the enquiry form'+(f' or <a href="mailto:{E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}">{E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}</a>' if CONTACT_EMAIL else '')+' and describe the request. Operator identity fields still marked pending must be completed before relying on this notice for a regulated launch.</p></div>'))
page('terms.html','Website and company information','Company identity and the scope of information on the HeyDock website.',hero('WEBSITE INFORMATION','A clear starting point.','HeyDock provides IT services, software and AI automation.')+section('COMPANY AND SITE SCOPE','How to read this website.','', '<div class="prose"><h3>Company details</h3>'+operator_privacy+'<h3>Services and proposals</h3><p>Descriptions outline services that may be scoped. Availability, price, attendance, delivery timelines, licences and support commitments are established through a separate proposal and agreement.</p><h3>Software catalogue</h3><p>Listings describe available solution categories. Specific modules, product features, vendor terms and implementation requirements are confirmed during scoping. The catalogue is not a claim of ownership of every underlying software product.</p><h3>Brand and domain</h3><p>HeyDock is the brand presented on this site. Domain registration and trademark clearance remain launch prerequisites where not yet completed.</p><h3>Enquiries</h3><p>Submitting the website form sends an enquiry for review. It does not by itself book an engineer, open a support contract or create a binding commercial agreement.</p></div>'))
page('accessibility.html','Accessibility','Accessibility features and review status for the HeyDock website.',hero('ACCESSIBILITY','Designed to be<br><em>easy to navigate.</em>','Clear content and accessible interactions are part of the website design.')+section('BUILT INTO THE SITE','Usability matters.','', '<div class="prose"><p>The site includes keyboard navigation, visible focus indicators, a skip-to-content link, labelled form controls, responsive layouts and reduced-motion support.</p><p>Software searches report the number of matching results. Forms use native validation and announce sending, success and failure states without relying on colour alone.</p><p>This is not a claim of formal accessibility certification. Feedback:'+(f' <a href="mailto:{E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}">{E(CONTACT_EMAIL)}</a> or' if CONTACT_EMAIL else '')+' use the <a href="/contact.html">enquiry form</a>.</p></div>'))
